{"availability":"available","full":"eigen-is/eigen","name":"eigen","description":"Your own workspace. A self-hosted, open source alternative to Google Workspace: mail, drive, docs, sheets, slides, calendar and chat.","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":42,"forks":1,"created":"2025-03-07T13:43:13Z","updated":"2026-10-02T19:27:24Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://eigen.is","topics":["bun","caldav","collaboration","crdt","email","europe","google-workspace-alternative","kanban","nextcloud-alternative","privacy","self-hosted","typescript","webdav","workspace","yjs"],"demo":"https://demo.eigen.is/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T10:32:25.260Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T10:32:25.260Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T10:32:25.260Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","stars":41,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-04T10:32:25.260Z","stars":42,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your own workspace. Simple, secure, self-hosted.","Try the live demo at demo.eigen.is. It is a shared workspace that resets every hour.","Eigen is a self-hosted alternative to Google Workspace. It runs as a single server with integrated apps for email, file storage, documents, spreadsheets, presentations, drawings, kanban boards, calendar, contacts, and real-time chat, all sharing one API, one auth system, and one UI."],"features":["One codebase. Nextcloud is a core with apps and plugins. Eigen's apps are built together: one API, one auth system, one UI. Everything is designed to work with everything else.","Collaboration is built in. In Nextcloud, collaborative editing comes from an external office server (Collabora or OnlyOffice). In Eigen, every app is collaborative through CRDTs (Yjs). Two people on the same document,…","Simple to run. One server, one compose file, SQLite per user. No PHP, no MySQL, no Redis. One command backs up the whole server while it runs."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eigen-is/eigen/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"355136fccb705c9ef6d2cb578af7b06e113a7008c972b01bfc71ed1fecac48d8","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:49.392Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Your own workspace. Simple, secure, self-hosted.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eigen-is/eigen/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The API logs a one-time link, Finish the setup at Open it to create your admin account and choose where files are stored.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eigen-is/eigen/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"355136fccb705c9ef6d2cb578af7b06e113a7008c972b01bfc71ed1fecac48d8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eigen-is/eigen/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:49.393Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T19:27:24Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:42.854Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eigen-is/eigen/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:49.394Z","hash":"355136fccb705c9ef6d2cb578af7b06e113a7008c972b01bfc71ed1fecac48d8","originalBytes":13154,"storedBytes":13154,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["eigen","server","one","own","mail","data","docs","bun","run","api","backup","collaborative","every","team","drive","keep","works","workspace","apps","built","chat","docker","each","email","how","lint","nextcloud","real-time","same","see","setup","standard","when","any","app","bash","built-in","calendar","contact","contributing.md","everything","file","full","only","organizations","over","project","runs","self-hosted","shared","sqlite","stored","user","web","webdav","workspace.","agents.md","alternative","auth","backs","caldav","calendars","carddav","check","collaboration","command","compose","contacts","core","covers","development","document","domain","drives","editing",